### Obtener todos los contactos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts

### Obtener un contacto filtrado por nombre
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts?q=ana

### Obtener un contacto filtrado estado
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts?state=Lead

### Obtener un contacto filtrado estado y nombre
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts?state=Contactado&q=carlos

### obtener contacto por id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111


### actualizar contacto
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/7aeb95a2-19e9-4f5a-b4a0-175af8df22fa
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Tester user",
    "email": "tester@example.com",
    "phone": "5917234567",
    "address": "123 Main St",
    "state": "Lead"
}   

### cambiar estado 
### Estados válidos: Lead, Contactado, Propuesta, Cliente, Inactivo
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/state
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "state": "Contactado"
}

### añadir contacto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Juana Peraz",
    "email": "juana@example.net",
    "phone": "7234567",
    "phonePrefix": "+591",
    "enterprise": "Tech Corp"
}

### delete contact
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/869c79c6-870b-4856-ab77-d6fb8b5b602e

### esport 
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/export

### swager
GET http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui/index.html